{"seq":3,"slug":"network-automation-iac","title":"网络自动化与 IaC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/network-automation-iac","wordCount":1516,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络自动化与-iac\">网络自动化与 IaC</h1><p>云网络的复杂度随着 VPC 数量、路由规则和安全策略的增长而指数膨胀——一个典型的企业环境可能有 50+ VPC、数百个安全组、数千条路由表条目。手动管理这些配置不仅效率低下，而且是安全事故的温床（配置漂移、遗留规则、未审计的变更）。基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code, IaC）和网络自动化是治理这种复杂度的唯一可持续路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>IaC（Infrastructure as Code）</strong>：用声明式代码描述基础设施状态，通过版本控制和 CI/CD 管理变更</li>\n<li><strong>配置漂移（Configuration Drift）</strong>：实际云资源状态与代码声明不一致，通常由手动变更引起</li>\n<li><strong>State 文件</strong>：Terraform 等工具维护的实际资源状态快照，是 plan/apply 的决策依据</li>\n<li><strong>GitOps</strong>：以 Git 仓库作为基础设施的单一事实来源，变更通过 PR 审批和自动化管道部署</li>\n<li><strong>护栏（Guardrail）</strong>：自动检测和修复违规配置的机制，如 AWS Config + SSM Auto Remediation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"iac-工具链选型\">IaC 工具链选型</h2><p>云网络 IaC 工具的选择取决于是否需要跨云支持、状态管理模式和团队技能栈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>状态管理</th>\n<th>跨云</th>\n<th>网络专长</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Terraform / OpenTofu</td>\n<td>HCL</td>\n<td>远程 State + Lock</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>所有云网络资源</td>\n<td>多云 / 跨团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS CDK / Pulumi</td>\n<td>TypeScript/Python/Go</td>\n<td>CloudFormation / Pulumi State</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>深度 AWS 集成</td>\n<td>单云 + 开发者友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CloudFormation</td>\n<td>YAML/JSON</td>\n<td>AWS 托管</td>\n<td>仅 AWS</td>\n<td>原生 AWS 资源</td>\n<td>AWS 原教旨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bicep</td>\n<td>DSL</td>\n<td>Azure Resource Manager</td>\n<td>仅 Azure</td>\n<td>Azure 网络</td>\n<td>Azure 原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crossplane</td>\n<td>Kubernetes YAML</td>\n<td>etcd (K8s)</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>声明式 + GitOps</td>\n<td>平台工程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph GitOps[&quot;GitOps 工作流&quot;]&#10;        Repo[Git Repository&lt;br/&gt;network-infra/] --&gt;|PR| Review[Code Review]&#10;        Review --&gt;|merge| Main[main branch]&#10;        Main --&gt;|trigger| Pipeline[CI/CD Pipeline]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph IaC[&quot;IaC 执行&quot;]&#10;        Pipeline --&gt;|terraform plan| Plan[变更预览]&#10;        Plan --&gt;|manual approve| Apply[terraform apply]&#10;        Apply --&gt; Cloud[云网络资源]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Drift[&quot;漂移检测&quot;]&#10;        Cloud --&gt;|定时扫描| Detect[drift detection]&#10;        Detect --&gt;|发现漂移| Alert[告警 + 自动修复]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph GitOps[\"GitOps 工作流\"]\n        Repo[Git Repository&lt;br/&gt;network-infra/] --&gt;|PR| Review[Code Review]\n        Review --&gt;|merge| Main[main branch]\n        Main --&gt;|trigger| Pipeline[CI/CD Pipeline]\n    end\n    subgraph IaC[\"IaC 执行\"]\n        Pipeline --&gt;|terraform plan| Plan[变更预览]\n        Plan --&gt;|manual approve| Apply[terraform apply]\n        Apply --&gt; Cloud[云网络资源]\n    end\n    subgraph Drift[\"漂移检测\"]\n        Cloud --&gt;|定时扫描| Detect[drift detection]\n        Detect --&gt;|发现漂移| Alert[告警 + 自动修复]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"terraform-网络模块设计\">Terraform 网络模块设计</h2><p>Terraform 的模块化是管理大规模网络配置的关键。一个经过验证的模块结构：</p>\n<p><strong>VPC 模块层级</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"modules/&#10;├── vpc/              # 基础 VPC（CIDR + DNS 配置）&#10;├── subnets/          # 子网组（按 AZ 和 tier 展开）&#10;├── routing/          # 路由表 + 路由条目&#10;├── security/         # 安全组 + NACL&#10;├── connectivity/     # TGW Attachment / Peering / VPN&#10;├── endpoints/        # VPC Endpoints（Interface + Gateway）&#10;└── firewall/         # Network Firewall 策略和规则组\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── vpc/              # 基础 VPC（CIDR + DNS 配置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── subnets/          # 子网组（按 AZ 和 tier 展开）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── routing/          # 路由表 + 路由条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── security/         # 安全组 + NACL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── connectivity/     # TGW Attachment / Peering / VPN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── endpoints/        # VPC Endpoints（Interface + Gateway）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── firewall/         # Network Firewall 策略和规则组</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>状态文件隔离</strong>：网络基础设施的 Terraform State 应独立于应用层。一个常见的 State 拆分策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>State 文件</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>network-core</td>\n<td>VPC, Subnets, TGW</td>\n<td>极低（季度级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>network-security</td>\n<td>Security Groups, NACL, Firewall</td>\n<td>中（周级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>network-connectivity</td>\n<td>VPN, Direct Connect, Peering</td>\n<td>低（月级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>network-dns</td>\n<td>Route 53 Zones, Resolver Rules</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种拆分的好处是：变更安全组不会意外影响 VPC CIDR 配置；每个 State 的 blast radius 受控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络策略即代码\">网络策略即代码</h2><p>网络安全策略的 IaC 化不仅是配置管理，更是<strong>合规可审计</strong>的关键：</p>\n<p><strong>安全组规则的声明式管理</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"# 声明式——Terraform 会自动删除代码中不存在的规则&#10;resource &quot;aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule&quot; &quot;app_from_alb&quot; {&#10;  security_group_id            = aws_security_group.app.id&#10;  referenced_security_group_id = aws_security_group.alb.id&#10;  from_port                    = 8080&#10;  to_port                      = 8080&#10;  ip_protocol                  = &quot;tcp&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 声明式——Terraform 会自动删除代码中不存在的规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule\" \"app_from_alb\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  security_group_id            = aws_security_group.app.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  referenced_security_group_id = aws_security_group.alb.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  from_port                    = 8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  to_port                      = 8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ip_protocol                  = \"tcp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键原则：使用 <code>aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule</code>（单条规则资源）而非 <code>inline ingress</code> 块——前者允许模块化组合和独立的生命周期管理。</p>\n<p><strong>Network Firewall 规则的版本控制</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rule Group (Suricata)</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>version control</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Git</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>CI validation</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Syntax Check</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>deploy</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Firewall Policy</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rule Group (Suricata)} \\xrightarrow{\\text{version control}} \\text{Git} \\xrightarrow{\\text{CI validation}} \\text{Syntax Check} \\xrightarrow{\\text{deploy}} \\text{Firewall Policy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3581em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rule Group (Suricata)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">version control</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Git</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CI validation</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3025em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Syntax Check</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deploy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Firewall Policy</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Suricata 规则可以存储在 Git 中进行版本控制。CI 管道中使用 <code>suricata --engine-analysis</code> 验证规则语法，然后通过 Terraform 或 AWS SDK 部署到 Network Firewall Rule Group。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置漂移检测与修复\">配置漂移检测与修复</h2><p>IaC 的最大敌人是<strong>配置漂移</strong>——某人通过控制台手动修改了网络配置，导致实际状态与代码声明不一致。</p>\n<p>检测漂移的三种方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Terraform Plan（定时）</td>\n<td>terraform plan -detailed-exitcode</td>\n<td>每小时</td>\n<td>告警 + 手动决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS Config Rules</td>\n<td>managed rule: vpc-sg-open-only-to-authorized-ports</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>自动修复 (SSM Remediation)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义扫描</td>\n<td>AWS Config Advanced Query / Steampipe</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>生成合规报告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>AWS Config + SSM Auto Remediation</strong>：配置规则（如&quot;安全组不允许 0.0.0.0/0 入站 SSH&quot;）在违规时自动触发 SSM Automation Runbook，移除违规规则并通知安全团队。这是&quot;护栏&quot;模式——不阻止操作但自动修复后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-管道中的网络变更\">CI/CD 管道中的网络变更</h2><p>网络配置变更的风险远高于应用部署——一个错误的路由可以导致全局断网。CI/CD 管道必须内建安全机制：</p>\n<p><strong>Plan 阶段检查清单</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>terraform plan</code> 输出不包含 <code>destroy</code> 关键网络资源（VPC / TGW / Direct Connect）</li>\n<li>安全组规则变更不引入 <code>0.0.0.0/0</code> 入站（除非显式白名单端口）</li>\n<li>CIDR 变更不与已知的 VPC 地址空间重叠</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>渐进式部署</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网络变更先在开发 VPC 验证</li>\n<li>使用 Route 53 Health Check 在切换前验证新路径的连通性</li>\n<li>TGW 路由变更使用 Blackhole 路由作为保护（先添加 Blackhole，验证无影响后再删除）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>回滚策略</strong>：Terraform State 支持 <code>terraform state</code> 级别的操作，但网络资源的回滚往往不能简单 <code>terraform apply</code> 上一个版本——因为某些资源（如 VPC Peering、Direct Connect VIF）有异步创建/删除过程。应维护&quot;已知良好配置&quot;的 State 快照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多账户网络自动化\">多账户网络自动化</h2><p>企业 Landing Zone（如 AWS Control Tower）中的网络自动化需要跨账户编排：</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Organizations + RAM + Terraform</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网络账户（Network Account）拥有 TGW、Direct Connect、集中式 Firewall</li>\n<li>工作负载账户通过 RAM 接收共享的 TGW 和子网</li>\n<li>Terraform 使用 assume_role 跨账户部署，State 集中存储在网络账户的 S3</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Service Catalog 自助服务</strong>：平台团队将审批通过的 VPC 模板发布为 Service Catalog 产品，应用团队一键申请——获得符合安全基线的 VPC + 子网 + 安全组 + TGW Attachment，无需理解底层网络配置。</p>\n<p>关于网络防火墙规则如何通过 IaC 管理部署，参见 <a href=\"network-firewall-waf\">网络防火墙与 WAF</a>。关于流日志如何作为网络自动化的反馈信号驱动策略调整，参见 <a href=\"flow-logs-monitoring\">流日志与网络监控</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网络 IaC 的核心价值是将网络配置从&quot;运维人员脑中的状态&quot;转化为&quot;Git 中可审计的代码&quot;。关键实践包括：按变更频率拆分 State 文件控制 blast radius、用模块化封装复杂网络组件、通过 CI 管道内建安全检查（禁止 0.0.0.0/0、禁止删除关键资源）、定期扫描配置漂移并自动修复。多账户环境中 Service Catalog 提供自助式 VPC 申请，平台团队确保每个 VPC 出厂即符合安全基线。网络自动化的最终目标是：任何网络变更都有代码审批记录、有自动化验证、可一键回滚。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络自动化与 IaC","id":"网络自动化与-iac"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"IaC 工具链选型","id":"iac-工具链选型"},{"level":2,"text":"Terraform 网络模块设计","id":"terraform-网络模块设计"},{"level":2,"text":"网络策略即代码","id":"网络策略即代码"},{"level":2,"text":"配置漂移检测与修复","id":"配置漂移检测与修复"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 管道中的网络变更","id":"ci-cd-管道中的网络变更"},{"level":2,"text":"多账户网络自动化","id":"多账户网络自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流日志与网络监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/flow-logs-monitoring"},"next":null}